{"availability":"available","full":"falconrapid19925/saasmath","name":"saasmath","description":"Gamified Kumon-style daily math drills for Indonesian kelas 4-6 SD — Next.js PWA, deterministic drill engine, offline-first, Midtrans/WhatsApp ready","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T06:17:38Z","updated":"2026-10-11T08:32:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://falconrapid19925.github.io/saasmath/","topics":["bahasa-indonesia","drizzle-orm","education","indonesia","kumon","math","nextjs","playwright","pwa","react","sqlite","typescript","vitest"],"demo":"https://falconrapid19925.github.io/saasmath/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.265Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.265Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.265Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.265Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try the static demo: a GitHub Pages landing page (Bahasa Indonesia) with a playable drill that runs the real engine in the browser (generateSet, gradeItems). The full app needs a server, and the page says so.","SaasMath is a web app (PWA) for Indonesian children in kelas 4-6 SD. Each day the child plays one timed 10-15 minute math drill, built the way Kumon works. A ladder of small-step sets carries the curriculum, and each set has a Standard Completion Time (SCT) target. A mastery gate decides advancement, and a failed gate repeats the set as a freshly generated variant.","Grading is instant and wrong answers trigger same-session self-correction. When a child stays stuck, a Singapore-math CPA layer intervenes with a visual hint, such as a bar model (model batang), before the abstract form returns. A streak, stars, and a toko give the loop its gamification."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/falconrapid19925/saasmath/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1d4a2602539c79bc3148735948